{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the grind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this ultra-focused idle clicker, you're not here to relax \u2014 you're here to dominate. Start from dirt and rise to an unstoppable resource empire. Every click, every choice, and every second matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd28 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Progression:</strong> Unlock systems layer by layer, with real consequences for every decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Crafting &amp; Unlock Paths:</strong> From soil and wood to advanced automation \u2014 everything is earned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prestige Mechanics:</strong> Reset for power. Replayability is baked into the core.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Scaling:</strong> Push your limits with exponential growth and soft/hard caps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Low System Impact:</strong> Designed to run in the background while you plan your next move.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is <strong>not</strong> just another idle game. It's made for <strong>tryhards, spreadsheet warriors</strong>, and players who love optimization as much as domination.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2691210?t=1751114064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2691210?t=1751114064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691210/d5481337dd376523d59e8dd644d8b7dcc694b006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751114064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691210/d5481337dd376523d59e8dd644d8b7dcc694b006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751114064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67}